findings.what:
HONEST ANSWER: no new inference-only or post-processing mechanism on x138 can meet R8 (27 Sep 12:00Z, ~3 h 20 min away). R8 needs a built kernel, a clean dummy (~40 min with queue), an honest lab gate and a NEW user OK, all before 12:00Z. Every candidate in IDEAS is in one of four states:
- closed;
- frozen: the DC family (I-345, I-349);
- post-deadline: I-323 Corwin secondary, I-324 coord-inject, I-352/I-353 amanatar V6 parts;
- tied to the answers above: E10, exp72.
No idea is re-proposed under a new name. After 12:00Z the only paths left are an E10 port (v1, or v2 if OK'd before 12:00Z) and exp72 (with an explicit yes).
